## 🔄 Version Control

### Branch Strategy

- `main` - Production-ready
- `develop` - Development
- `feature/[name]` - New features
- `fix/[name]` - Bug fixes

### Commit Messages

```
type(scope): brief description

- Detailed change 1
- Detailed change 2
```

**Types:** `feat`, `fix`, `docs`, `refactor`, `test`, `chore`

**Examples:**

- `feat(workflow): add skill extraction workflow`
- `fix(matching): correct score calculation`
- `docs(readme): update setup instructions`

### What to Commit

- ✅ Documentation (.md files)
- ✅ Sample data (.csv)
- ✅ Frontend code (.html, .js)
- ✅ Workflow exports (.json - without credentials)
- ⛔ API keys or secrets
- ⛔ .env files
- ⛔ n8n credentials
- ⛔ Airtable data dumps

---

## ⚡ Performance & Optimization

### API Call Reduction

- Use Airtable views instead of filtering in n8n
- Batch operations (10 records max per call)
- Cache frequently accessed data
- Only fetch required fields

### LLM Cost Optimization

- Use gpt-4o-mini by default (10x cheaper than gpt-4o)
- Minimize prompt length
- Cache similar requests
- Batch where possible

### Workflow Efficiency

- Filter early in the pipeline
- Avoid unnecessary transformations
- Use parallel branches when possible
- Set appropriate timeouts

---

