## 🐛 Debugging Approach

### When Something Breaks

1. Check n8n execution logs
2. Enable debug mode in Function nodes
3. Validate input data structure
4. Check API credentials are valid
5. Review rate limits (Airtable: 5 req/sec, OpenAI: 3 RPM)
6. Test nodes individually
7. Check error trigger path

### Debug Mode Template

```javascript
const DEBUG = true;

if (DEBUG) {
  console.log("Input:", JSON.stringify($input.all(), null, 2));
  console.log("Result:", JSON.stringify(result, null, 2));
}
```

